1
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:06,490
各位安静一下 听我简单说几句
Can I get everybody's attension. Real quick.

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:08,890
在这个美好的日子里
Um, on this wonderful occasion--

3
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,360
我们的女儿明日即将离家步入大学
Our daughter leaving tomorrow for college...

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,300
请各位一起举杯
If I could get everyone to raise their glass.

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,000
容我引用我国一位伟大的父亲
As I quote from one of our nation's great fathers--

6
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,240
杰斐逊
Jefferson.

7
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:19,820
乔治·杰斐逊
George Jefferson.

8
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,060
我没想到我的孩子
"I never dreamed that one of my own

9
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,480
有朝一日会进入大学
"would be going off to a university,

10
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,560
但今天我作为一个自豪的黑人
"but here I stand, a proud black man,

11
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,860
明白我耗费在干洗机上的日日夜夜
knowing that all those hours I put in at the dry cleaner--"

12
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,355
-菲尔 -别打岔 维兹
- Phil. - Not now, Weezie.

13
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:30,260
我说到哪儿了
Where was I?

14
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:31,140
你在引用杰弗逊"总统"的话
Quoting that president.

15
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:33,100
如果她也算是美国的未来
Okay, if she's the future of America,

16
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,680
我们还是赶紧用人民币吧
we should start using Chinese money now.

17
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,040
我们早就在花中国人的钱了
We already are.

18
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,600
我手都举酸了 祝贺海莉
My arm is tired. To Haley.

19
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,151
祝贺海莉
To Haley!

20
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:42,040
在各位放下杯子以前
And before everyone puts their glasses down,

21
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,820
我们也有莉莉的喜事宣布
uh, uh, we're also very proud of Lily.

22
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:47,240
明天是她第一次上幼儿园的日子
Tomorrow is her first day of kindergarten.

23
00:00:49,171 --> 00:00:50,820
-祝贺莉莉 -莉莉
- To Lily. - Oh, Lily.

24
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:51,880
祝贺莉莉 你们要知道
To Lily. And you'll be impressed to know

25
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,400
她会是全班最聪明的小姑娘
that she's gonna be one of the smartest girls there.

26
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:55,440
莉莉宝贝 64的平方根是几
Lily, sweetie, what's the square root of 64?

27
00:00:56,225 --> 00:00:57,160
好厉害啊
Wow. Hey!

28
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,180
真狡猾
Nice trick.

29
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,840
莉莉 土豆的平方根是几
Hey, Lily, what's the square root of this potato?

30
00:01:01,552 --> 00:01:03,679
恭喜你们 养出只大鹦鹉来
Congratulations. You have a parrot.

31
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:07,640
海莉的祝酒词还没结束
We couldn't even get through the toast to Haley

32
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,200
你就让莉莉来抢风头了
before you pulled focus to Lily.

33
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:11,980
拜托 今天是她们俩的大日子好吗
Oh, come on. It's--it's a big day for both of them. Huh?

34
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:13,860
海莉能进大学是奇迹
Haley going to college is a miracle.

35
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,480
莉莉进幼儿园却是法律强制规定
Lily going to kindergarten is the law.

36
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:19,780
海莉和莉莉不是唯一开始上学的人
Well, Haley and Lily aren't the only ones starting school.

37
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:22,420
我妈和杰要去上育儿班了
My mom and jay are going to parenting class.

38
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:23,440
我们是为了宝宝才去的
We're doing it for the baby.

39
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,660
不是她肚子里这个 是那个活"宝"
Not this baby. That baby.

40
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,420
曼尼不相信我们能尽好父母之职
Manny doesn't believe that we know what we're doing.

41
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:30,880
腋窝的毛刚长出几根
A couple of new hairs under his arm,

42
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:33,020
他就觉得自己比他妈懂得多了
and now he thinks he knows more than his own mother.

43
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:34,560
我至少懂得不去
I know not to embarrass my son

44
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,100
羞辱儿子青春期的正常发育现象
as he stands on the threshold of manhood.

45
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,720
我干嘛非要去上那个课
I don't know why I have to go to this thing.

46
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:39,800
你们应该记得 我带大了两个孩子
In case you've forgotten, I raised two kids.

47
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:42,320
别扯我的头发
Stop pulling my hair.

48
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,599
-别拧我的奶头 -闭嘴闭嘴
- Stop twisting my nipple. Ow! - Shut up. Shut up.

49
00:01:46,152 --> 00:01:48,391
干嘛看我 都是他们老妈的错
Why look at me? It was their mother's fault.

50
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,520
我基本就不在家
I was barely around.

51
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,359
好疼
No! Ow, ow!

52
00:02:04,860 --> 00:02:06,440
海莉 你这些化妆用品
Haley, this is, like, the third bag

53
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,740
和护发器材都装满第三箱了
of makeup and hair care products.

54
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:10,220
爸 要想得高分 就得靠脸蛋
Dad, if you want me to get good grades, I have to look cute.

55
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:11,380
别吐我的槽
Don't say a word.

56
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,760
不 我同意你那句话的假设前提
No. No. I agree with that premise.

57
00:02:12,940 --> 00:02:14,600
谢谢啊 等一下
Thank you. Wait.

58
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:17,100
好吧 谢谢你
Yeah, thank you.

59
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:20,020
克莱尔
Claire.

60
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,940
海莉的行李里有一盒保险套
In Haley's stuff, a box of condoms.

61
00:02:23,305 --> 00:02:25,967
是的 是我买给她的
Yeah. Um, I-I bought those for her.

62
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:28,880
什么 你怎么不直接给她买双渔网袜
What? Why don't you just buy her some fishnet stockings

63
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,880
再加套护士制服装呢
and a nurse's outfit?

64
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:32,480
我不是制服控 只是脑海突然冒出了这画面
Not that that's my thing. That just popped into my head.

65
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,800
亲爱的 她已成年了 又将去上大学
Honey, she's an adult, and she's going to college.

66
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,880
我必须现实一些
I want to be realistic.

67
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:37,660
我不希望她"套到用时方恨少"
I don't want her to get caught unprepared.

68
00:02:37,660 --> 00:02:40,874
24个套套 你这是准备了4年份吗
24 times? What, are you buying her a 4-year supply?

69
00:02:40,995 --> 00:02:43,119
拜托 菲尔 那才够我
Please. Phil, that would've lasted me

70
00:02:43,119 --> 00:02:44,440
和大学男友来一次长时间的
and my college boyfriend, like, a long--

71
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:46,340
不听不听不听
La, la, la, la, la, la, la!

72
00:02:46,945 --> 00:02:48,481
好 我们该走了
Okay, we gotta hit the road.

73
00:02:48,481 --> 00:02:49,940
你们姐妹俩拥抱再见吧
Give your sister a hug good-bye.

74
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:53,300
别把房间弄得太书呆气了
Don't dork up our room.

75
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:55,560
别在大学里和同学睡成一片
Don't slut up your college.

76
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,500
说真的 别太努力学习了
Seriously, though, don't study too hard, okay?

77
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:03,060
我会玩得很开心的
I'm totally going to have fun.

78
00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:05,400
我在模拟联合国中代表冰岛呢
I'm Iceland in the mock U.N.

79
00:03:06,281 --> 00:03:07,700
妈 我们要失去她了
Mom, we're gonna lose her.

80
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:09,060
我会尽力阻止的
I am doing my best.

81
00:03:09,628 --> 00:03:12,120
卢克 过来和姐姐说再见
Luke, come say good-bye to your sister.

82
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,660
我来了
I'm right here.

83
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,800
再见海莉 玩得开心点
Bye, Haley. Have fun.

84
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:19,200
别喝太多啤酒和龙舌兰
Don't drink too much beer and shots of tequila.

85
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:20,600
你带着面具干什么
Why are you wearing that mask?

86
00:03:21,211 --> 00:03:22,443
我喜欢
Uh, I like it.

87
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:24,420
他是不想让你看到他流泪
He doesn't want you to see him cry.

88
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:26,380
他用面具罩住了自己的情绪
He's literally masking his emotions.

89
00:03:26,780 --> 00:03:26,900
不是的
No!

90
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:28,817
-真感人 -过来
- That's so sweet. - Come here.

91
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:31,540
没什么感人的 我是邪恶电子人
It's not sweet. I'm an evil cyborg.

92
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:34,420
半边脸都在工业事故中烧毁了
Half my face was burned off in an industrial accident,

93
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:37,180
面具是用来掩饰让我的发声设备的
and the mask is hiding the servos that control my mouth.

94
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,760
是的 海莉离家我很难过
Yes, I am sad Haley is leaving,

95
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,700
但我很放心 因为我已经尽了一切努力
but I'm gonna be okay knowing I've done everything I can

96
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:48,680
让她万事俱备 即将迈出自立的第一步
to get her set up and prepared and off on the right foot.

97
00:03:48,860 --> 00:03:51,320
我没有 我们在宿舍向她道别的一刻
Not me. When we're standing in her dorm room saying good-bye,

98
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:54,060
将是我人生中最激动的时刻之一
it's gonna be one of the most emotional moments of my life.

99
00:03:54,605 --> 00:03:56,533
我会比第一次看《神犬巴迪》哭得还厉害
I'm gonna cry harder than the first time I saw "Air bud"...

100
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,960
尤其是在我交给她这个时
Especially when I give her this.

101
00:04:01,551 --> 00:04:03,000
《菲尔之道》
"Phil's-osophy."

102
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:06,120
我总结出的人生道理精装版
A hardbound collection of all the life lessons I've learned,

103
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:08,140
比如
such as...

104
00:04:08,140 --> 00:04:12,040
"永远直视对方的双眼
"Always look people in the eye,

105
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,440
哪怕对方是盲人"
"even if they're blind.

106
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:17,000
告诉他们 我正看着你的双眼
Just say, 'I'm looking you in the eye.'"

107
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,560
或者
Or...

108
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:21,400
"如果你因超速被拦住
"If you get pulled over for speeding,

109
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,820
告诉警察你同伴有拉肚之急"
tell the policeman your spouse has diarrhea."

110
00:04:28,266 --> 00:04:29,501
《菲尔之道》
Phil's-osophy.

111
00:04:31,933 --> 00:04:34,307
看看这里多好玩啊 莉莉
Look how much fun you're gonna have here, Lily.

112
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:36,360
这么多好玩的玩具
So many great toys to play with,

113
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,265
你会交到好多朋友的
and you're gonna make so many new friends.

114
00:04:38,581 --> 00:04:40,191
真希望我再读一次幼儿园
Oh, I wish I was in kindergarten again.

115
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,040
我可不要 我说过大卫·安东尼的事没
Oh, not me. Did I ever tell you about David Anthony?

116
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:43,640
他以前叫我"肉卡"
He used to call me "Cam the ham."

117
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,125
-今天的主角是莉莉 -你说得对
- Okay, Lily's day. - Yeah, you're right.

118
00:04:45,125 --> 00:04:47,240
知道吗 你今天一定会很开心
You know what? It's gonna be a great day.

119
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,400
不过 名字和"火腿肉"押韵
I'm just saying, it's difficult to grow up

120
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:49,460
成长过程就比较艰辛
with a name that rhymes with "ham."

121
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,860
是吗 米奇 巫气 抽泣
Hello? Mitch? Witch. Twitch.

122
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:52,920
贱器
Bitch.

123
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:54,360
伊莱恩·斯特里奇
Elaine Stritch.

124
00:04:54,660 --> 00:04:54,940
什么
What?

125
00:04:55,380 --> 00:04:56,440
不是只有直男才欺负人
Not all bullies are straight.

126
00:04:56,778 --> 00:04:58,416
好了 各位家长
Okay, parents...

127
00:04:58,701 --> 00:05:00,572
12点再来接孩子吧
Oh! We'll see you at 12:00.

128
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:01,903
稳住
All right. Mm!

129
00:05:01,945 --> 00:05:03,498
这时候眼泪就开始止不住了
This is when the crying starts.

130
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:05,400
有停止的时候吗
Does it ever stop?

131
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:06,560
别这样 小卡
Come on, Cam.

132
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,692
莉莉 我的宝贝
Okay. You know what, Lily, sweetie?

133
00:05:08,692 --> 00:05:10,260
我知道离别总是伤人心
I know this is gonna be difficult--

134
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:10,700
再见
Bye!

135
00:05:11,025 --> 00:05:13,484
好吧 真是一刀直戳我心
Okay. That was a knife to the heart.

136
00:05:13,484 --> 00:05:15,642
别 这是好事 别这样
No, it's--it's a good thing. Come on.

137
00:05:16,512 --> 00:05:18,507
糟了 她忘了拿零食
Oh, you know what? She forgot her snack. Oh.

138
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,000
她去哪儿了
Where'd she go?

139
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,760
好疼 好疼
Ow! That hurts! Ow! That hurts!

140
00:05:25,134 --> 00:05:26,140
莉莉宝贝
Oh, Lily, honey!

141
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:28,140
宝贝 过来 快过来
Sweetheart, come here. Come here.

142
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:32,120
你再把你那小脏手伸向我女儿
If you ever put your hands on my daughter again,

143
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:34,840
我就把你倒栽葱挂在旗杆上
I will string you up by your feet, run you up the flagpole,

144
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:37,340
让鸟活生生啄出你的眼珠子来
and let the birds peck out your eyes.

145
00:05:38,060 --> 00:05:38,920
你听懂了吗
You understand?

146
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,800
塔克先生 把那孩子放下来
Mr. Tucker, put that boy down!

147
00:05:45,380 --> 00:05:46,940
他拉了我女儿的头发
He pulled my daughter's hair.

148
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,980
请你向康纳道歉
Please apologize to Connor

149
00:05:48,980 --> 00:05:51,940
因为你动了手 而非动口
for using your hands instead of your words.

150
00:05:52,940 --> 00:05:53,880
对不起了 小家伙
Sorry, little fella.

151
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:57,040
请你们到我办公室来
I would like to see you in my office. Right.

152
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,924
-现在就来 -我也要去吗
- Now, please. - Me, too? Oh.

153
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,520
够了 别惹他了
Stop it. Leave him alone.

154
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,000
塔克先生 刚才的事是不可接受的
Mr. Tucker, what happened out there was unacceptable.

155
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:18,400
我同意 这是幼儿园还是饥饿游戏啊
I agree. Is this kindergarten or "The hunger games"?

156
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,180
我说的是你的行为
I'm speaking of your behavior.

157
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:22,000
我们从没遇到这种事
We've never had an incident like this,

158
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,620
现在开学第一天就发生了
and now we've had one on the first day,

159
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:24,700
还没到班级集合时间呢
Before circle time.

160
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,320
你们到底在想什么
What the fudge were you thinking?

161
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:28,880
现在这孩子的家长也来了 相信我
Now the boy's parents are coming in, and trust me,

162
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,080
她们简直是愤怒的凯蒂猫
they're mad as hello kitty.

163
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,080
你向他家长告状啦
Oh, you told his parents on us?

164
00:06:32,804 --> 00:06:34,540
这实在 太不够意思了
That is--that is so not cool.

165
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:35,940
我相信一旦他们听到自己儿子的所为
Well, I'm sure once they hear what their boy did,

166
00:06:35,940 --> 00:06:36,940
他们也会理解的
they will be understanding.

167
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,120
哪个吃了雄心豹子胆
All right, whoever made our son cry

168
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,480
敢惹我们家宝贝儿子
has messed with the wrong moms.

169
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:44,500
拉拉们
Lesbians.

170
00:06:45,299 --> 00:06:47,829
虽然基佬和拉拉常被人扯在一起
While often lumped together, gay men and lesbians

171
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:49,800
但实际我们之间并没有什么交集
have less in common than one might think.

172
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:52,560
就好比性别认同的交集图
Like in the Venn Diagram of sexual identity,

173
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,900
我是基佬
You have gay men...

174
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,300
我是直男
And straight men.

175
00:06:55,980 --> 00:06:57,320
我们性别一样
Both the same gender.

176
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:59,360
我是基佬
Then you have gay men...

177
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:00,780
我是直女
And straight women.

178
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,100
我们都爱男人
Both attracted to the same gender.

179
00:07:03,820 --> 00:07:05,180
可基佬和拉拉们呢
But gay men and lesbians?

180
00:07:06,744 --> 00:07:07,520
不行
No.

181
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:07,880
毫无交集
Nothing.

182
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:11,360
抱歉以这种方式和你们见面
I am so sorry we have to meet like this,

183
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:13,140
但我想同为家长 你们可以理解
but I'm sure you can understand, as parents,

184
00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:15,240
保护自己孩子的那种本能
the instinct to protect your child.

185
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,980
是啊 所以我想一拳狠狠砸在你脖子上
Yeah, it's what makes me want to punch you in the neck right now.

186
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:20,020
哇 我终于明白你儿子的暴力倾向源自何处了
Wow. I see where your son gets all of his aggression.

187
00:07:20,159 --> 00:07:22,300
好了 二位都消消火吧
Okay, let's all take a time-out.

188
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:24,140
真是个好主意 战火烧得有点大
That's a good idea. This is getting a little heated.

189
00:07:24,380 --> 00:07:24,940
是啊 帕姆
Yeah, Pam,

190
00:07:24,940 --> 00:07:26,960
别又闹出上次在木材场那样的事故
we don't want another incident like at the lumberyard.

191
00:07:27,460 --> 00:07:29,460
天啊 你们也去木材场啊
Oh, my god. You guys go to the lumberyard, too? D--

192
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:31,760
我不知道那儿也办"女士之夜"呢
I didn't know they had a ladies' night.

193
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,320
不是说"木材场酒吧" 蠢蛋
Not the bar, sally.

194
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:35,600
其实 他是想友善示好
Okay, you know what? He's trying to be nice,

195
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,820
你却叫他蠢蛋
And you just called him "Sally."

196
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:38,740
是啊 你简直是越帮越乱 小甜心
Yeah, you're not being very helpful, peppermint patty.

197
00:07:38,835 --> 00:07:40,713
好吧 我们就叫真名好吗
Okay. Let's just stick to our actual names.

198
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:41,460
够了
Enough.

199
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:44,120
我要给你们分配一项家庭作业
I'm gonna give you a little homework assignment.

200
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:46,980
我希望你们和孩子们一起来个家庭欢聚会
I want you and your kids to have a family playdate.

201
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:48,700
如果你们四个可以和睦相处
Maybe if the four of you can get along,

202
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:50,860
也可以为孩子们树立个好榜样
You can set a better example for your children.

203
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:53,120
我觉得那是个好主意 帕姆
I think that's a wonderful idea. Pam?

204
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,000
-好吧 -小卡
- Fine. - Cam?

205
00:07:55,380 --> 00:07:56,820
好吧 不过显然是由我们来主持
Fine. We'll host, obviously.

206
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:57,960
"显然"吗
"Obviously"?

207
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,460
我猜想你们家一定还有木工活没做完吧
I assume you have an unfinished woodworking project at your house.

208
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:01,940
你真是胆大 出言放肆
You've got a lot of nerve.

209
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:03,920
是啊 你做了半个独木舟还在我们家客厅里呢
Yeah, and you've got half a canoe in our living room.

210
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:07,280
我很期待尝尝你们做的馅饼
I look forward to your frittata.

211
00:08:07,700 --> 00:08:09,740
那么老套的东西 你当现在是2008年啊
Oh. Why, are you visiting us in 2008?

212
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:10,871
老天啊
Oh, my god.

213
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:19,180
你得好好解释一下为什么生个黑娃了
You have some explaining to do.

214
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:22,420
我很抱歉娃出生了你才发现我的奸情 杰
I'm so sorry that you had to find out like this, Jay.

215
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:25,300
哇 你肚子那么大了 怀孕挺久了吧
Wow, you two are really far along.

216
00:08:25,503 --> 00:08:27,814
我们才刚刚处于怀孕前三个月
We're, uh, we're still in our first trimester.

217
00:08:27,814 --> 00:08:29,129
真好
Ay, that's nice.

218
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:31,180
是啊 我们多年来一直都在努力生个孩子
Yeah, we've been trying to get pregnant for ages.

219
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,500
她是拉丁人 做个鬼脸笑笑都能怀孕
She's Latina. You just gotta look at her funny.

220
00:08:34,581 --> 00:08:37,855
好了 现在大家手上都有娃娃了
Okay, now that everyone has their doll,

221
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:39,980
我们先来讲一下怎么包孩子
Let's talk about swaddling.

222
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:42,820
首先 你们要把毯子的一角
Now you want to start by turning one corner of the blanket

223
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:44,480
折向自己 折个菱形
toward you, like a diamond,

224
00:08:44,860 --> 00:08:46,900
从上面折起来
And folding the top down,

225
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:48,360
就像这样
Like this.

226
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:51,320
我觉得医院把我们的孩子搞错了
I think they made a mistake at the hospital.

227
00:08:54,140 --> 00:08:54,800
全教室的人都没笑点
Tough room.

228
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,520
然后将另外一个角折过来
Now we are going to pull the other corner 'round,

229
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:00,940
整齐服帖地掖到一起
And tuck it in nice and snug

230
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,540
就像玉米煎饼一样
Like a burrito.

231
00:09:02,780 --> 00:09:04,460
完成 我胜了
Done! I win.

232
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,240
这不是比赛
It's not a race.

233
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,914
你说得太对了 跟比赛差远了
You're darn right. It wasn't even close.

234
00:09:11,303 --> 00:09:14,600
好吧 你包得不错 但有点太紧了
Okay, it's good, but it's a little tight.

235
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:17,120
是你说玉米煎饼的啊 不能让里面的肉掉出来
It's a burrito. You don't want the meat to fall out.

236
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:19,186
看着 像这样
Here. And try like this.

237
00:09:21,833 --> 00:09:22,997
瞧见了吗
And see?

238
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:26,120
现在你们的宝宝可以呼吸了
Now your baby can breathe.

239
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:31,920
我一手开车 一手都能将我儿子包好
I wrapped my son with one hand while driving a stick.

240
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:34,140
我很清楚该怎样保证宝宝的安全
I think I know how to keep a baby safe.

241
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:39,720
天啊 我真喜欢重归宿舍的感觉
Man, I love being back in the dorms.

242
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,000
就像我从未离开过
It's like I never left.

243
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:43,940
贴张大卫·科波菲尔的海报
Throw up a David Copperfield poster,

244
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:44,960
简直就跟我的宿舍一模一样
this could be my room.

245
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:47,440
亲爱的 我陪海莉去填一些文件
Honey, Haley and I have to go fill out some paperwork.

246
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:50,340
你就把亚麻衣服放床上吧
Why don't you throw the linens on the bed?

247
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:52,000
-然后把车挪个位置 别被拖走了 -好
- Oh, and move the car before they tow us. - Okay.

248
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:54,120
老天啊 你那T恤是怎么回事
Oh, my god. What is that shirt?!

249
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:56,615
超有爱的吧 海莉·邓菲搬家公司
Pretty sweet, huh? "Haley Dunphy moving co."

250
00:09:56,615 --> 00:09:58,855
因为我们要把你"搬"到这里 上面也是
'cause we're moving you here and here.

251
00:09:59,160 --> 00:09:59,980
还有...
And also...

252
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:01,640
心里
Here.

253
00:10:03,060 --> 00:10:05,040
女儿 以前你可喜欢拉着我们的手荡秋千了
Man, you used to love it when we swung you like that.

254
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,700
我觉得现在还是可以做的吧
I bet we could still do it.

255
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:08,340
-是啊 -是啊
- Yeah! - Yeah.

256
00:10:08,340 --> 00:10:09,640
噢不不不不
Oh, no, no. No, no, no, no, no.

257
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,360
你们敢来拉我 还有 赶快把那衣服脱了
Don't you dare pick me up! And take that shirt off.

258
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,340
-什么 为什么 -多有爱啊
- What? Why? - It's cute!

259
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:16,060
一点都没有爱 你没看见现在的状况吗
It's not cute! Do you see what's happening out there?

260
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,000
大家都转来转去互相吐槽鄙视
People are walking around and judging each other.

261
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:18,900
不 才没有呢
No, they're not.

262
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:19,740
是吗
Oh, really?

263
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:20,620
你们没看见
You didn't see the way

264
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,080
大厅对面向我投来的各种淫邪眼光吗
muffin top across the hall was looking at me?

265
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:24,200
大学生的嘴是很恶毒的 赶紧脱下来
People can be cruel. So take it off.

266
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:25,720
好吧
Fine.

267
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,460
天啊 快把衣服穿上
Oh, my god! Put on a shirt!

268
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,200
我不知道你到底想让我搞哪样
I don't know what you want from me!

269
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:34,080
第一印象一旦定下就无法更改
"You only get one chance at a first impression.

270
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:37,680
我建议模仿厨神茱莉亚 因为那很简单
I suggest Julia Child, because it's easy to do."

271
00:10:38,464 --> 00:10:40,367
"留着内脏别扔"
"Save the giblets."

272
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:43,900
该去沙滩了
Time to go to the beach!

273
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:46,184
你想带着狗去沙滩吗
You're gonna go to the beach with a dog?

274
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:47,200
我真不知道我干了什么好事
I don't know what I did

275
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,600
-得到这样一个好孩子 -是啊
- to deserve this. - Yeah.

276
00:10:48,952 --> 00:10:50,787
我想带康纳去看我的玩具
I want to show Connor my toys.

277
00:10:50,787 --> 00:10:52,456
好啊 去吧 宝贝
Oh, okay. You do that, sweetie.

278
00:10:52,487 --> 00:10:54,550
嘿 康纳 别再扯人家头发了
Hey, Connor, uh, no hair pulling.

279
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:55,760
谢谢你
Thank you for that.

280
00:10:55,770 --> 00:10:58,794
好了 我做了各种春卷
Okay, we have an assortment of spring rolls here.

281
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:01,100
都是素馅的 当然了
All vegetarian, of course.

282
00:11:01,293 --> 00:11:04,342
因为我是拉拉 我就肯定是个素食主义者吗
Oh, 'cause I'm a lesbian, I'm automatically a vegetarian?

283
00:11:04,784 --> 00:11:05,600
我在《拉字至上》那部剧中看到的
Well, I saw it on "The L word."

284
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,540
人家编剧也不是乱编的吧
I assume they have consultants.

285
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,620
我想说 那是世人对拉拉冒犯性的刻板印象
I'm just saying it's an offensive stereotype.

286
00:11:08,620 --> 00:11:11,085
够了 帕姆 你确实是素食主义者啊
Okay, Pam, you are a vegetarian.

287
00:11:11,860 --> 00:11:12,920
别装了吧
Knock it off.

288
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:13,500
碰对了
Worked out.

289
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:17,260
是啊 真高兴我们可以这样和睦地相处
Yeah. So glad that we are doing this.

290
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,200
-是啊 我也是 -是啊
- Yeah. Yeah, me, too. - Yeah.

291
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,220
我们是班里唯一的同性恋家长
I mean, we're the only gay parents in the class.

292
00:11:21,220 --> 00:11:22,680
是啊 我们该互相支持才对
Yeah, we should be supporting one another.

293
00:11:22,740 --> 00:11:24,620
我是说 我们有那么多共同点
I mean, we have so much in common.

294
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,400
就是啊
Exactly.

295
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:31,420
所以
So...

296
00:11:31,702 --> 00:11:32,780
介绍一下你们自己吧
Tell us about yourselves.

297
00:11:32,780 --> 00:11:34,300
我是个环保法律师
I'm an environmental lawyer.

298
00:11:34,331 --> 00:11:35,837
我是个家庭主夫
Uh, and I'm a homemaker.

299
00:11:38,103 --> 00:11:39,640
你 你们是干什么的
And--and, uh, and what do you do?

300
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,080
我是个理财顾问
I'm a financial consultant.

301
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,480
我是个承包商
I'm a contractor.

302
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:46,380
你以为我是个体育老师吗
You thought I was a P.E. teacher?

303
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:47,780
猜的
Well, figured.

304
00:11:47,780 --> 00:11:48,860
我有个小问题要问
Hey, I have a question real quick.

305
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:50,560
你们是怎么把儿童座椅绑上摩托车的
How do you guys get the car seat on the motorcycle?

306
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:53,380
话说 康纳的生日会就在下周
Uh, you know, Connor is having a birthday next week.

307
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:54,720
不知道莉莉愿不愿意去
Maybe Lily would like to come.

308
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,880
她一定非常乐意
Oh, she would love that.

309
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:57,180
真好 你们要请小丑吗
Oh, great. Are you guys having a clown?

310
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:58,460
天啊 当然不要
Oh, god, no.

311
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,500
我最讨厌小丑了 慎得慌
I hate clowns they're so creepy.

312
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,900
你不喜欢 或许是因为他们会化妆吧
Maybe you just don't like them because they wear makeup.

313
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:06,480
算了 我走了
You know what? I'm out.

314
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,540
-好吧 -帕姆
- Okay. - Pam.

315
00:12:07,540 --> 00:12:08,560
康纳 我们要走了
Connor, we're leaving!

316
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,168
-你误会了 -帕姆 帕姆
- You--you don't understand. - Pam! Pam!

317
00:12:10,168 --> 00:12:11,200
小卡曾经是个小丑
Cam used to be a clown.

318
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,600
曾经吗 一日为小丑 终身为小丑
"Used to be"? Once a clown, always a clown.

319
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,357
天啊 别现在发作 别挑现在
God! Not now! Not now!

320
00:12:14,620 --> 00:12:15,800
康纳 我们走了
Connor, let's go.

321
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,240
帕姆
Pam.

322
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:21,600
为什么门是锁着的
Why is this door locked?

323
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:22,720
过来 让我来
Here. Let me, please.

324
00:12:23,940 --> 00:12:25,480
莉莉 立刻把门打开
Lily, open this door right now.

325
00:12:26,569 --> 00:12:28,780
好吧 里面一点声音都没有
Okay. I'm not hearing anything.

326
00:12:28,780 --> 00:12:29,720
我确定他们平安无事的
I'm sure they're fine.

327
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,163
你怎么确定的
Oh, how are you sure?

328
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:32,460
康纳
Connor!

329
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:34,140
-莉莉 -康纳
- Lily! - Connor!

330
00:12:34,380 --> 00:12:34,860
莉莉
Lily!

331
00:12:38,780 --> 00:12:41,280
将水温调到舒适的温度
Make the water comfortably warm

332
00:12:41,340 --> 00:12:43,540
最多90-100华氏度
90 to 100 degrees max.

333
00:12:43,760 --> 00:12:46,360
千万别将宝宝一个人放在澡盆里
And never leave the tub unsupervised.

334
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:51,420
你们有什么好笑的事要跟全班人分享一下吗
Is there something you two want to share with the class?

335
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:53,520
没有 是下流的笑话
No. It's dirty.

336
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:56,260
不好意思 你们不学我们还想学呢
Excuse me. We're trying to learn here.

337
00:12:56,400 --> 00:13:00,140
别太担心 宝宝们是很强悍的
Don't worry so much. Babies are tougher than you think.

338
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:03,140
我5岁的时候 我的保姆是只山羊
When I was 5 years old, my babysitter was a goat.

339
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:03,680
什么
What?

340
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:05,947
别惊讶 我跟你说过洛佩的啊
Ay, please. You know about Lupe.

341
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,080
你从来没说她是只山羊
You never said she was a goat.

342
00:13:07,100 --> 00:13:08,340
其实 班里能有一对
You know, it's great that we have

343
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:11,180
有经验的父母是件好事
a couple of experienced parents in the class.

344
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:15,020
或许你们可以和大家分享一下你们的育儿经
Perhaps you can share some of your wisdom with the rest of us.

345
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,340
必须的 又不是造火箭那种高科技
Absolutely. It's not rocket science.

346
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:18,623
不就是宝宝嘛 饿了 你就喂
It's babies. They're hungry, you feed 'em.

347
00:13:18,623 --> 00:13:20,620
他们出牙的时候 就喂他们喝苏格兰酒
They're teething, you give 'em some scotch.

348
