00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:49,560
总之
Anyway,

532
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:52,836
我得挂了 明早7点有新生入学会
I should probably get going. We have orientation at 7:00 a.m.

533
00:19:53,155 --> 00:19:54,654
祝你好运 宝贝
G-good luck with that, sweetie.

534
00:19:56,780 --> 00:19:57,940
我爱你们
I love you, guys.

535
00:19:59,179 --> 00:20:00,564
我们也爱你 亲爱的
We love you, too, honey.

536
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:02,840
非常爱
So, so much.

537
00:20:03,320 --> 00:20:03,760
拜
Bye.

538
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:05,160
拜 海莉
Bye, Haley.

539
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:07,720
我会想你们的
I'll miss you.

540
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:23,320
结婚要找看起来性感与失望并存的人
"Marry someone who looks sexy while disappointed."

541
00:20:24,840 --> 00:20:25,300
明白不
See?

542
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:29,760
年老的黑人女性做的冰茶最好喝
"Older black ladies make the best iced tea."

543
00:20:31,980 --> 00:20:33,540
成功来自于1%的灵感
"Success is 1% inspiration,

544
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:36,420
98%的努力
98% perspiration,

545
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:39,260
以及2%对细节的注意
and 2% attention to detail."

546
00:20:39,260 --> 00:20:43,480
通过一个人的自传 你可以很好地了解他
"You can tell a lot about a person from his biography."

547
00:20:45,820 --> 00:20:47,720
一天至少看一次日出
"Watch a sunrise at least once a day."

548
00:20:49,380 --> 00:20:51,780
如果你爱着什么 给它自由
"If you love something, set it free,

549
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:52,920
除非它是只老虎
unless it's a tiger."

550
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:56,160
如果你碰到塞车
"If you're ever in jam,

551
00:20:56,380 --> 00:20:58,020
两嘴嘟起在鼻子下夹支蜡笔
a crayon scrunched up under your nose

552
00:20:58,020 --> 00:20:59,680
就是一撇完美的假胡子
makes a good pretend mustache."

553
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,220
生活给了你甜甜的柠檬水
"When life gives you lemonade,

554
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:03,460
你就把它变成酸酸的柠檬
make lemons.

555
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:05,720
生活就会大吃一惊说 你搞毛啊
Life will be all like, 'what?!'"
